# The sha256 pin of the Windows apps bundle in the public bundles bucket (docs/DOWNLOADS.md, "Windows app bundle").
# STATUS: EMPTY, 2026-11-07. No pin means the bundle was never packaged and uploaded: scripts/bench/box/windows_apps.sh
# answers RETRY class=MEDIA (never a pass). The owner fills it with the line that package_bundle.py writes
# (bundle.pin.line) AFTER uploading `winapps-open.iso`; one line, exactly:
#   winapps-open.iso sha256=<64 lowercase hex digits>
# Builder v6 emits inputs=<sha256>, inventory=<sha256>, and both immutable object keys.
# These metadata comments do not change the first-line consumer format above.
